                # and pushing the following block (a card grid) too far down. Tag
                # that lone row with its REAL px so the pixel pass draws exactly hmb
                # WITHOUT a global blank-row shrink (which regressed sticky/grid).
                # Guard on a single emitted row (multi-row / collapsed gaps keep the
                # uniform pitch the row-quantised scroll offset assumes).
