                # previously DROPPED here (items packed at the bare line pitch,
                # halving the vertical rhythm of every list-driven page: link lists,
                # nav menus, article indexes). For the 2nd+ sibling emit the authored
                # gap = collapse(prev item margin-bottom, this item margin-top). List
                # items share one selector in the overwhelming majority of cases, so
                # this item's own margin-bottom stands in for the (equal) previous
                # item's. Quantised to whole rows like every other vertical margin in
                # this row-based engine. Emitted while the previous item's row is
