                    # closing it must only END the last content row — NOT strand an
                    # extra blank paragraph-gap row below the grid. The old
                    # _para_break() added that spurious row (~19px) after EVERY
                    # top-level table (isolated single-line table 119px -> Chrome ~81px;
                    # HN's four top-level/nested-frame tables each shed one). Any margin
                    # separating the table from following content now comes solely from
                    # the FOLLOWING block's own top margin (g_vgap_fresh is already 0 —
                    # the cell content cleared it — so that margin still emits in full).
                    _soft_newline()
